@startuml Get_Sent_Announcements
title Activity Diagram - Get Sent Announcements

|Instructor|
start
:Open Announcements page;
:Click "My Announcements";

|Web Application|
:Send request to retrieve\nsent announcements;

|Backend API|
:Extract admin/instructor ID\nfrom JWT token;
:Call AnnouncementService.\nGetAnnouncementsByAdminAsync(adminUserId);
:Query database:\nGet announcements where\nadminId = {adminUserId};
:Include related data:\n- Admin (User);
:Order by CreatedAt DESC;

if (Announcements found?) then (yes)
  :Map to AnnouncementResponseDto;
  :Return List<AnnouncementResponseDto>;
  :Send 200 OK response;
else (no)
  :Return empty list;
  :Send 200 OK response;
endif

|Web Application|
if (Response successful?) then (yes)
  :Display announcements list\nwith title, content,\ntarget audience, and date;
else (no)
  :Display error message;
  stop
endif

|Instructor|
:View sent announcements list;
stop
@enduml

